 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "The angels are never drawn or symbolised; Ibrahim and his wife get no plate, figure or drop. A scroll for «بالبشرى» (the news as a message, after Ibrahim's name; a gold burst could read as the angels), a house for his hospitality («فما لبث أن جاء بعجل حنيذ»); no calf, hands or people drawn. 71:1-2 «قائمة» is not glossed: the tafsirs differ (serving the guests / listening behind the curtain). No plate on «إسحاق» or «يعقوب». The plan's title «ضيف إبراهيم» is Quran wording (15:51, 51:24): now «بشارة الملائكة»."
 },
